## Component Roles

### Edge Router — One Job

```
Accept inbound WireGuard (UDP YOUR_VPN_PORT)
Accept inbound HTTPS (TCP 443) → forward to server
NAT home devices to internet
Run Skynet blocklist + Diversion DNS
Hand out DHCP to home devices only
Know nothing about what is below it except one LAN port
```

### Middle Router — One Job

```
Accept one WAN connection from edge router
Provide one subnet (YOUR_MIDDLE_SUBNET) to server only
Run lightweight watchdog agent
Forward metrics and logs to server
Know nothing about Labs or what is above edge router
```

### Server — The Choke Point

```
Route all Labs traffic (mandatory — no bypass possible)
Run kill switch (wlan0 down = Labs dark)
Run full AI agent stack
Run production HTTPS site
Receive and centralize all logs
Be the only thing Labs devices know as their gateway
```

### ScryptGate — The Hardware Gate

```
Sit on YOUR_MIDDLE_SUBNET
Expose three endpoints only
Verify PoW on every agent request
Hash model weights before inference loads
Fail closed if unreachable
See ScryptGate README for full documentation
```

