## Threat Model

|Threat                        |This Architecture’s Response                                   |
|------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
|Internet port scan            |Only 443 visible — everything else filtered                    |
|DDoS on public IP             |Caddy rate limiting — edge router absorbs                      |
|Attacker reaches edge router  |Middle router is next — different credentials, different subnet|
|Attacker reaches middle router|Server is next — different credentials, kill switch available  |
|Attacker on home network      |No route to Labs — structural isolation                        |
|Malicious agent action        |ScryptGate PoW + human approval required                       |
|Tampered inference model      |ScryptGate model integrity verification                        |
|SSH brute force               |fail2ban + key-only auth + non-standard ports                  |
|DNS spoofing                  |DNSSEC + DNS-over-TLS                                          |
|Compromised container         |SELinux enforcing — cannot escape to host                      |
|Disk theft                    |LUKS2 — useless without passphrase                             |
|WireGuard key theft           |Revoke peer on edge router — immediate                         |

